        Fact("whales", "nature", "Whales breathe air with lungs.", "They are mammals and must surface to breathe through their blowholes. They do not extract oxygen from water using fish-like gills.", "Being adapted to life in water does not mean an animal breathes the way a fish does.", "NOAA Fisheries — Whales: https://www.fisheries.noaa.gov/whales"),
