        "disciplined" to listOf("Make the next promise small enough to keep.", "Give the important thing a clear beginning.", "Repeat the useful step, not the perfect plan.", "A little preparation makes starting easier.", "Choose one thing and give it your attention.", "Let consistency be quiet.", "A missed day is information, not an identity.", "Do the manageable part first.", "Make starting easier than postponing.", "Set a stopping point as well as a starting point.", "Give your attention a single destination.", "Prepare the place before demanding the effort.", "A clear next step beats an impressive vague intention.", "Build a routine that leaves room for being human.", "Notice what worked, then make it repeatable.", "Protect a small promise from a crowded plan.", "Choose a pace you can return to.", "Let your effort have a boundary.", "Finish one useful piece before adding another.", "Make room for recovery in the plan."),
